uation configuration\n3\nAchievement criteria\nAchievement criteria depend on the evidence this evaluation model produces. Changing the model changes what can be required here.\nAchievement criteria\nEvidence available: Observed only / Performed with assistance / Performed with supervision / Performed independently\nTOTAL DEMONSTRATIONS REQUIRED\nMINIMUM AT EACH LEVEL\nObserved only\nPerformed with assistance\nPerformed with supervision\nPerformed independently\nMINIMUMS BY CLINICAL SETTING\nOptional. Pick every setting that matters for this skill, then set how much evidence each one needs. Anything not listed carries no requirement.\n2 selected\nInpatient\nEmergency\nLab or simulation evidence does not count toward any setting requirement.\nCONFIGURATION LINEAGE\nEVALUATION MODEL\nDemonstration-Level Outcome\nEVIDENCE PER EVALUATION\nObserved only / Performed with assistance / Performed with supervision / Performed independently\nAN EVALUATION QUALIFIES WHEN\nEach completed demonstration counts as evidence\nACHIEVEMENT CRITERIA\n4 demonstrations · 1 performed with supervision · 2 performed independently · 1 in Inpatient · 1 in Emergency\nSKILL STATUS\nNot Started → In Progress → Achieved\nEach step below the model is determined by the one above it. This is what keeps evaluation setup and achievement criteria from contradicting each other.\nStep 3 of 3 — Achievement criteria\nCancel\nBack\nSave skill","tree":{"t":"div","box":[0,0,1440,900],"kids":[{"t":"div","box":[0,0,1440,900],"css":{"display":"flex","dir":"row","bg":"rgb(248, 250, 252)"},"kids":[{"t":"aside","box":[0,0,240,900],"css":{"bg":"rgb(15, 23, 42)","pos":"sticky z30"},"kids":[{"t":"div","box":[0,0,239,64],"css":{"pad":"20px"},"kids":[{"t":"p","text":"exxat","box":[20,20,199,24],"css":{"fs":"16px","fw":"600","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","ls":"-0.4px"},"kids":[{"t":"span","text":"Prism","box":[63,23,42,18],"css":{"fs":"16px","fw":"600","color":"rgb(96, 165, 250)","ls":"-0.4px"}}]}]},{"t":"nav","box":[0,64,